{'symbol': 'QRVO', 'date': '2022-08-25 08:00:00', 'title': 'QORVO® GAN PA MODULE DELIVERS HIGHEST GAIN FOR L-BAND APPLICATIONS', 'text': 'GREENSBORO, N.C., AUG. 25, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- QORVO®\xa0(NASDAQ: QRVO), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF CONNECTIVITY AND POWER SOLUTIONS, TODAY INTRODUCED THE HIGHEST GAIN 100 WATT L-BAND (1.2-1.4 GHZ) COMPACT SOLUTION: A GAN-ON-SIC POWER AMPLIFIER MODULE (PAM) TARGETING COMMERCIAL AND DEFENSE RADAR APPLICATIONS. THE QPA2511 GAN-ON-SIC PAM INCLUDES AN INTEGRATED TWO-STAGE AMPLIFIER SOLUTION OFFERING 60% POWER ADDED EFFICIENCY IN A CIRCUIT SIZE 70% SMALLER THAN EQUIVALENT TWO-STAGE SOLUTIONS. THIS UNPARALLELED PERFORMANCE SIGNIFICANTLY REDUCES OVERALL SYSTEM POWER CONSUMPTION.'}